    <li><a href="https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/guide/kimi-k3-1-pro-quickstart" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Kimi API: K3.1 Pro model and implementation guide</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://platform.kimi.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Kimi API: current K3.1 Pro, Highspeed, and K3 prices</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://platform.kimi.ai/docs/pricing/chat" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Kimi API: billing rules and K2 retirement notice</a></li>
  </ul></div>
</KnowledgeLayout>
